  "objectives": [
    "看到 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$ 或 $(x^2+a^2)^n$ 且換元配不起來時，會令 $x=a\\tan\\theta$，$\\theta\\in(-\\frac\\pi2,\\frac\\pi2)$",
    "會用「對邊 $x$、鄰邊 $a$、斜邊 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$」的三角形換回 $x$",
    "會積 $\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}$ 與 $\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+a^2)^2}$",
    "分母是 $x^2+px+q$ 時，會先配方再代換"
  ],
  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 需要的恆等式",
      "body": [
        "上一課：$a^2-x^2$ 用 $1-\\sin^2\\theta=\\cos^2\\theta$",
        "這一課是加號，要找「$1+\\square^2=$ 平方」",
        "$\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta=1$ 兩邊除以 $\\cos^2\\theta$：",
        "令 $x=a\\tan\\theta$，$-\\dfrac\\pi2<\\theta<\\dfrac\\pi2$：",
        "這個範圍 $\\sec\\theta>0$，絕對值拿掉：",
        "範圍是 $\\arctan$ 的值域：$\\theta=\\arctan\\frac xa$；不含端點，因為 $\\tan$ 在 $\\pm\\frac\\pi2$ 沒有定義",
        "$(x^2+a^2)^n$ 也一樣：$x^2+a^2=a^2\\sec^2\\theta$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\tan^2\\theta+1=\\sec^2\\theta",
        "\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}=a\\sqrt{\\tan^2\\theta+1}=a\\lvert\\sec\\theta\\rvert",
        "\\begin{aligned}x&=a\\tan\\theta,\\quad dx=a\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta\\\\\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}&=a\\sec\\theta\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 換回 $x$ 的三角形",
      "body": [
        "$\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac xa$：對邊 $x$、鄰邊 $a$",
        "斜邊（畢氏定理）：$\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$，又是原來的根號",
        "讀出來：",
        "跟上一課比：根號從鄰邊搬到斜邊"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\sec\\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}a,\\qquad\\sin\\theta=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}",
        "\\cos\\theta=\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 結果一：$\\int\\sec\\theta$",
      "body": [
        "例一：$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}$，$a=1$",
        "$x=\\tan\\theta$，$dx=\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$，$\\sqrt{x^2+1}=\\sec\\theta$：",
        "4.25 學過：",
        "換回：$\\sec\\theta=\\sqrt{x^2+1}$，$\\tan\\theta=x$",
        "$\\sqrt{x^2+1}>\\lvert x\\rvert$，所以 $x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}>0$，絕對值可以拿掉",
        "一般的 $a$：",
        "換回來是 $\\ln\\frac{x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}a$，多出的 $-\\ln a$ 是常數，併進 $C$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "=\\int\\frac{\\sec^2\\theta}{\\sec\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\int\\sec\\theta\\,d\\theta",
        "\\int\\sec\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\ln\\lvert\\sec\\theta+\\tan\\theta\\rvert+C",
        "\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}=\\ln\\big(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1}\\big)+C",
        "\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}=\\ln\\big(x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}\\big)+C"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 結果二：平方在分母",
      "body": [
        "例二：$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+1)^2}$",
        "$x^2+1=\\sec^2\\theta$，所以分母是 $\\sec^4\\theta$：",
        "半角公式：",
        "三角形：$\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\cdot\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}=\\dfrac x{x^2+1}$",
        "數值驗算：從 $-0.5$ 積到 $2$，兩邊都約 $1.1854$",
        "順便：沒有根號、一次方的"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "=\\int\\frac{\\sec^2\\theta}{\\sec^4\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\int\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta",
        "=\\frac\\theta2+\\frac{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}2+C",
        "\\begin{aligned}&\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+1)^2}\\\\&=\\frac{\\arctan x}2+\\frac{x}{2(x^2+1)}+C\\end{aligned}",
        "\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2+a^2}=\\int\\frac{a\\sec^2\\theta}{a^2\\sec^2\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\frac1a\\arctan\\frac xa+C"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 定積分與練習",
      "body": [
        "$x=\\tan\\theta$：$x=0\\to\\theta=0$，$x=\\sqrt3\\to\\theta=\\frac\\pi3$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^{\\sqrt3}\\frac{dx}{(x^2+1)^{3/2}}",
        "=\\int_0^{\\pi/3}\\frac{\\sec^2\\theta}{\\sec^3\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\int_0^{\\pi/3}\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta",
        "=\\sin\\theta\\Big|_0^{\\pi/3}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 分母是 $x^2+px+q$",
      "body": [
        "有一次項：先配方，變成 $u^2+a^2$",
        "例：$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+4x+8)^{3/2}}$",
        "令 $u=x+2$（$du=dx$），$u=2\\tan\\theta$：",
        "三角形：$\\sin\\theta=\\dfrac{u}{\\sqrt{u^2+4}}$",
        "數值驗算：從 $-3$ 積到 $1$，兩邊都約 $0.3198$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "x^2+4x+8=(x+2)^2+4",
        "=\\int\\frac{2\\sec^2\\theta}{8\\sec^3\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\frac14\\int\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\frac14\\sin\\theta+C",
        "\\begin{aligned}&\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+4x+8)^{3/2}}\\\\&=\\frac{x+2}{4\\sqrt{x^2+4x+8}}+C\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
      "body": [
        "• 看到 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$ 或 $(x^2+a^2)^n$，配不起來：令 $x=a\\tan\\theta$",
        "• $1+\\tan^2\\theta=\\sec^2\\theta$：$\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}=a\\sec\\theta$，$dx=a\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$",
        "• 三角形：對邊 $x$、鄰邊 $a$、斜邊 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$",
        "• $\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}=\\ln\\big(x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}\\big)+C$",
        "• $\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+1)^2}=\\frac{\\arctan x}2+\\frac{x}{2(x^2+1)}+C$",
        "• 有一次項：先配方",
        "下一課：$\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}$，換成正割"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "workedExamples": [
